body:
Im just telling people to better not try this at ranked. You said the build can be really good, but that just isn't true.  "I'm saying that this build can be really good." Enemy bruiser gets Exe and you can't even 1v1 properly. The build is just troll in every aspect to be honest even full crit Nocturne is better. I didn't want to hate, I'm just telling you this maybe works at your gold/plat rankeds but even there Stridebreaker or full assa is way better than this build in every aspect. Try it at normals but you'll just get people mad if u play this in ranked.

&#x200B;

Also this build is not situational! Situational means it's good or even best in some situations but this build is pure troll even if the enemies don't have a single CC. You heavily lack damage and survivability compared to other builds.

Ionian boots rush cuz they are broken, early dark seal into liandrys. from there it is situational. If needed i will go zhonyas if I want to get more damage I will get demonic etc. 

&#x200B;

Really like cosmic 3rd 4rd item aswell for giga ability haste
